  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Secretary General&apos;s Covid-19 Response and Recovery Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The multi partner  fund aims at reducing human, economic, and social suffering caused by the Covid-19 pandemic in the most vulnerable countries, with UN agencies as implementing partners. It operates at the nexus of humanitarian, recovery and development action to tacle the health emergency; focus on the social impact, and the economic response and recovery; and help countries recover better.</narrative>
  </description>
